ht|n|at|^*GA1,1.  Count tricks and signals correctly to significantly help your defense^*N|
                  
ht|o|at|^*GA2,2.  Mis-defense again^*N|
                  
ht|p|at|^*GA3,3.  If you know what you want to bid, then just bid it^*N|
                  
ht|q|at|^*GA4,4.  5 level decisions are very difficult^*N|
                  
ht|r|at|^*GA5,5.  4-4-4-1 hands are difficult to bid using standard bidding^*N|
                  
ht|s|at|^*GA6,    ^*N|


