qx|A3|st||rh||ah|Board 3 IMPs   -   On September 25, 2024|pn|hondo717,IraCT,danpsych,Sputniks|
md|1S4HQJT52D876C9853,SKQT865H76DAT5CJT,SA3H984DJ9432CA64,SJ972HAK3DKQCKQ72|sv|e|
mb|P|mb|2S|mb|P2n|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Why are you bidding 2N (which you should alert as |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=ogust,Ogust^*N|CP||FP||at|)? You know you want to be in 4@S regardless of how partner answers to Ogust. Even if he shows the best hand he can have by responding 3@S (two of the top 3 spades and 8+ HCP), you are not planning on bidding slam.|

n#|9|at|^^^fIf you do follow the link you can return  HERE  by clicking the  |fp|1|n#|3|at|@L|fp||n^|3|at|   icon button, top left.|

http://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/downloadlin.php?filename=mentoring2412a.lin
