nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|With your hand you should just bid 4@S which will interfere and help prevent us from finding a good sacrifice. Bidding 4@S right away makes that almost impossible.|
PG| ***** 45 ***** |


