UP|52|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|5 level decisions are very difficult. In 4 spades, they lose 2 hearts, 2 diamonds and 2 clubs for only down 2 for +300 for us. So 5@H making is a much better score. But if we go down in 5@H, which is very possible then obviously better to set them.|
PG| ***** 80 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|You just need to have some general principles for deciding when to bid 5 over a sacrifice. You tend not to if you are not short in their suit or if you are not vulnerable and they are vul. At equal vulnerability, and particularly when you are vulnerable and they are not it becomes a much more difficult decision I gave North the reasons why I decided to bid 5, but they don't always work. Fortunately it worked out this time.
|
PG| ***** 81 ***** |


